s and not the node itself. This applies when it's selected in the tree directly or picked from the game viewport, since both go through the same code path.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6e17b77f-4c9f-47b5-ad78-5968feb507cd\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/25b861cf-2b03-4ca1-ad6b-524539320596\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nPreviously, selecting a node in the remote scene tree would cause that node to be expanded, revealing its children.\r\nThis differs from the local scene tree, where selecting a node does not expand the node. I'm assuming this is not the intended behavior.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n🤖 I used Claude Code to help identify the root cause along with manual tracing using GDB.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","